OL,6,     FZayd Ayers Dohrn grew up in an
OL,7,     Funderground world of secrecy. His
OL,8,     Fparents were leading a violent
OL,9,     Fmovement which planted bombs,
OL,10,     Frobbed banks, and broke militants
OL,11,     Fout of jail.
OL,12,G1850 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 2004, Uruguayans voted to
OL,14,     Fenshrine water as a human right in
OL,15,     Ftheir constitution, the first
OL,16,     Fcountry in the world to do so.
